            "value": "This archive contains the data and Python code generating figures for the article \"Evidence of orbital ferromagnetism in twisted bilayer graphene aligned to hexagonal Boron Nitride\" by Aaron L. Sharpe, Eli J. Fox, Arthur W. Barnard, Joe Finney, Kenji Watanabe, Takashi Taniguchi, M. A. Kastner, and David Goldhaber-Gordon. \r\n\r\nA preprint of this paper is available at https://arxiv.org/abs/2102.04039",
